      50.64,
      343.3,
      220.44,
      380.45
    ],
    "text": "Notice under Section 7",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      11.998800277709961
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      381.91,
      286.44,
      479.31
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No.: \u0db8\u0dc4/\u0d89/\u0d85\u01ae/UDA/325. IT is hereby notified under Sub-section (1) of Section 07 in Land Acquisition Act amended by Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act No. 28 of 1964 that the government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public affair.",
    "fonts": [
      "IskoolaPota",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      11.998800277709961,
      13.918607711791992
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      480.79,
      286.44,
      585.17
    ],
    "text": "Details of the land intended to be acquired: The land described below, situated in Polwatte Grama Niladhari Division No. 529 of Maharagama Divisional Secretariat area of authority, Colombo district of Western Province with an extent of around 0.2941 Hectares and shown in main plan No. Co 9636, prepared by the Surveyor General.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      11.998800277709961
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      586.64,
      286.39,
      642.56
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 01 Name of Land: Atambagahawattha or Kurundugaha-wattha Old Polwattha; Land Utilization: Home Garden; Entitled Persons: Cannot be traced; Extent: 0.2857 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.04,
      331.28,
      540.35,
      375.92
    ],
    "text": "2. Lot No. 02 Name of Land: Atambagahawattha; Land Utilization: Home Garden; Entitled Persons: The State; Extent: 0.0084 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.04,
      377.08,
      540.36,
      442.64
    ],
    "text": "All the persons claiming entitlement, rights or other affiliations to the above land shall stand before me in person or through their representatives empowered by documents issued by them, at Maharagama Divisional Secretariat on 16th November, 2016 at 9.00 a.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.04,
      443.8,
      540.35,
      543.68
    ],
    "text": "Furthermore, I should be informed by way of a document in two copies as to the nature of their entitlement regarding the said land, details of matters enabling them to request compensation on the acquiring of the said land, compensation amount and how it was calculated, before 09th day of November, 2016. Deeds required for confirming entitlement and their extracts and other documents should be presented to me at the inquiry.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.04,
      544.63,
      537.24,
      643.76
    ],
